                "Description": "FDA Pharmacology Summary",
                "Value": {
                    "StringWithMarkup": [
                        {
                            "String": "Bethanechol is a Cholinergic Muscarinic Agonist. The mechanism of action of bethanechol is as a Cholinergic Muscarinic Agonist.",
